---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About - Poetry Submissions Directory">
	<main class="about-container">
		<a href="/" class="back-link">&larr; Back to Directory</a>
		
		<h1>About SUBtexts</h1>
		
		<div class="content-block">
			<p>This site is not intended to help you send hundreds of submissions to large numbers of magazines indiscriminately. Poetry editors are overworked and underpaid, and vitally, pivotally important to our poetry scene. Please respect them by reading submission guidelines very carefully, and by submitting only to magazines which you've carefully selected as being appropriate for your work. Wherever you can, please consider buying the magazines you're interested in submitting to. </p>

			<p>Next, a disclaimer. This site is updated dynamically (ie automatically, using fairly amateurish code). That's entirely my fault, although it's also true that poetry magazines are *terrible* at providing structured information about when they're accepting submissions. As a result, lots of magazines' submission status will quite likely remain as 'Unknown', and some of those listed as 'Open' or 'Closed' will be innacurate. The statuses (Open, Closed, Soon) are checked roughly once a week, in rolling daily batches of forty.</p>			
			
			<h2>How to Use This List, Though, In Theory</h2>
			<ul>
				<li><strong>Open:</strong> They are currently accepting unsolicited submissions. Check their guidelines for specific formatting rules.</li>
				<li><strong>Closed:</strong> Their reading window is currently shut.</li>
				<li><strong>Soon:</strong> They have an upcoming submission window opening shortly.</li>
			</ul>

			<h2>Contact</h2>
			<p>If you run a magazine and need your details updated, or if you spot an error – or if you'd like to help out, or if you have ideas of how to improve things – please feel free to email me on poetrysubssite@gmail.com.</p>
		</div>
	</main>
</Layout>

<style>
	.about-container {
		max-width: 800px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding: 3rem 0;
	}

	.back-link {
		display: inline-block;
		margin-bottom: 2rem;
		color: #555;
		text-decoration: none;
		font-weight: 500;
	}

	.back-link:hover {
		color: #000;
		text-decoration: underline;
	}

	h1 {
		font-size: 2.5rem;
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
	}

	h2 {
		font-size: 1.5rem;
		margin-top: 2.5rem;
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
	}

	p, li {
		font-size: 1.1rem;
		line-height: 1.6;
		color: #333;
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
	}

	ul {
		padding-left: 1.5rem;
		margin-bottom: 2rem;
	}
</style>